      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s2_sub_007_select_02",
      "hash64": "ECD7BBA38AFC5ABB",
      "text": "I feel like I know you...",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s2_sub_007_kakutou_02",
      "hash64": "F9A04BA118EF06FB",
      "text": "Oh, that’s right! I forgot we’re not wearing our\\nusual outfits today...[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s2_sub_007_aku_04",
      "hash64": "BBF286AC09D8CD30",
      "text": "Man, now that you mention it, I guess this is the\\nfirst time [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]she’s seeing us lookin’ all proper in our\\r\\nacademy uniforms, huh?\\c\\nYeesh. Now I feel all awkward about it...[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 107,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 133,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 178,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s2_sub_007_aku_05",
      "hash64": "BBF287AC09D8CEE3",
      "text": "But hey, let’s clear things up. It’s me—Giacomo!\\nOr DJ Vice when you catch me at the deck![VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s2_sub_007_kakutou_03",
      "hash64": "F9A04AA118EF0548",
      "text": "Eri here! But I’m sure that was obvious.[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s2_sub_007_aku_06",
      "hash64": "BBF288AC09D8D096",
      "text": "We came in today to take some makeup tests.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s2_sub_007_aku_07",
      "hash64": "BBF289AC09D8D249",
      "text": "Figured it was about time we started clawin’ back\\nall that learnin’ we missed out on while we were\\r\\nholed up in our bases.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 124,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s2_sub_007_kakutou_04",
      "hash64": "F9A051A118EF112D",
      "text": "Our Team Star outfits aren’t all that practical\\nfor tests and things, so we came in our new\\r\\nschool uniforms today.[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 117,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s2_sub_007_aku_08",
      "hash64": "BBF292AC09D8E194",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Hey, Eri... You think [VAR 0x0100(0000)]\\ncould\\r\\nhelp\\r\\nus\\r\\nout\\r\\nwith\\r\\nour\\r\\nongoing sitch?[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
