    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s2_sub_007_kakutou_05",
      "hash64": "F9A050A118EF0F7A",
      "text": "Hey, that’s right! Great idea, Giacomo![VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s2_sub_007_select_03",
      "hash64": "ECD7BAA38AFC5908",
      "text": "What’re you both thinking?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s2_sub_007_select_04",
      "hash64": "ECD7C1A38AFC64ED",
      "text": "Can I help with something?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "s2_sub_007_aku_09",
      "hash64": "BBF293AC09D8E347",
      "text": "We’ve got a little proposal for ya...[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "s2_sub_007_aku_10",
      "hash64": "BBF610AC09DBED85",
      "text": "How’d you like to be a tutor?![VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "s2_sub_007_kakutou_06",
      "hash64": "F9A04FA118EF0DC7",
      "text": "Geez, one step at a time! Maybe we should start\\nby explaining what’s going on?[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "s2_sub_007_aku_11",
      "hash64": "BBF60FAC09DBEBD2",
      "text": "Whoops. Right you are, Eri.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "s2_sub_007_aku_12",
      "hash64": "BBF60EAC09DBEA1F",
      "text": "So, ah, OK. Basically, the other Team Star bosses\\nare havin’ a rough time of it...[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "s2_sub_007_kakutou_07",
      "hash64": "F9A04EA118EF0C14",
      "text": "You remember Mellie, Ortie, and Atticus, right?[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "s2_sub_007_aku_13",
      "hash64": "BBF60DAC09DBE86C",
      "text": "Those three, yup. They’ve been takin’ makeup\\ntests like us, but they sure ain’t passing ’em...[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "s2_sub_007_aku_14",
      "hash64": "BBF60CAC09DBE6B9",
      "text": "They might actually have to repeat the year,\\nwhich would suck after all the effort they put in\\r\\nto come back to school.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 121,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "s2_sub_007_aku_15",
      "hash64": "BBF60BAC09DBE506",
      "text": "Before you ask—me an’ Eri have already tried\\ntutoring them ourselves...[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "s2_sub_007_kakutou_08",
      "hash64": "F9A045A118EEFCC9",
      "text": "But it didn’t go well. At all.[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "s2_sub_007_aku_16",
      "hash64": "BBF60AAC09DBE353",
      "text": "Nope. You know, I seriously didn’t think those\\nthree’d have such a hard time.\\c\\nI mean, for me, it feels like all you need to do to\\npass tests is learn formulas and memorize stuff.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 181,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "s2_sub_007_aku_17",
      "hash64": "BBF609AC09DBE1A0",
      "text": "Guess I just can’t wrap my head around what it is\\nthey can’t wrap their heads around...[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "s2_sub_007_kakutou_09",
      "hash64": "F9A044A118EEFB16",
      "text": "And I’m only good at teaching people if it’s to\\ndo with sports or exercise...[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "s2_sub_007_aku_18",
      "hash64": "BBF618AC09DBFB1D",
      "text": "We heard from Penny that your grades are\\npretty decent.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
